The key to setting up stashes is feeling confident that you can access
them easily and that means an ability to levelport.  Cursed scrolls of
teleport, the Eye and the Orb are all invaluable for levelport.  It's
as close to a "get out of jail free" as possible.

It's much easier to avoid the packrat mentality once you know that your
stashes are available and then you can concentrate on using your few
key tools wisely.

I like to play wizards and the branch porting with the eye means that I
am always close to my stash, post quest.  It's a huge advantage.  You
should also consider making the stash as safe as possible.  Many of the
worst baddies will follow you and that makes it worth while to have
something of a fort available.



